      "message": "Just a heads up, this means for the machine equipped rt1739 must fail and retry for 30 times (3 for the loop * 10 for the i2c nak retry setting).\n\nI suggest we do this:\n\n```\nstatic int test_ppc_idx_boards_connected_to(void)\n{\n\tint rv;\n\tint val \u003d 0;\n        \n\tfor (int i \u003d 0; i \u003c 3; i++) {\n\t\trv \u003d i2c_read8(ppc_chips[0].i2c_port,\n\t\t\t       ppc_chips[0].i2c_addr_flags, 0x00, \u0026val);\n\t\tif (!rv) {\n\t\t\treturn 0;\n\t\t}\n\t        \n\t\trv \u003d i2c_read8(ppc_chips[1].i2c_port,\n\t\t\t       ppc_chips[1].i2c_addr_flags, 0x00, \u0026val);\n\t\tif (!rv) {\n\t\t\treturn 1;\n\t\t}\t\n        }\n        \n        return -1;\n}\n```\n\nthen we would have better responsiveness on both ppc chips.",
